  "notes": "Param checks read ControlInputParameters as rendered text (keys sorted, ParameterName before ParameterValue). They match the parameter name by the setting's word, because the exact API name (requiredRetentionDays) is not in the prompt; a wrong API name is a deployability failure, not an intent failure. The five listed controls are a required list ('all five'), and controls_in_one_framework binds them to one framework. AWS::Backup::AuditManagerFramework (written by one real template) is not a real resource type and stays rejected."
